# Main GIF: browse into a folder, preview files with Space, see git state, change the theme.
Output assets/readme/main.gif
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Source assets/readme/tapes/lib/common.tape
Type "lazyfinder" Enter
Wait+Screen@20s /Favorites/
Show
Sleep 1s

Down
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Space
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 1.5s
Down
Sleep 1.5s
Space
Sleep 600ms

Backspace
Sleep 800ms
Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type ","
Sleep 1.2s
Right
Sleep 1.2s
Right
Sleep 1.2s
Escape
Sleep 1.5s

Type "q"
